  solar budgets = 4.180e-06 a0 (at mh = 0.01) — short of the MOND job (=1 a0) by 2.4e+05.
  -> the SHAPE wall alone closes the magnitude-keyed channel by ~5 orders, independent of the
     ~80-order coupling wall in [N3-B2]. Two independent walls, each sufficient.

